#X text 20 2280 The warn is armed and the recovery is not: a device that has not answered since load is absent \, not lost \, which is normal on a Mac. lost still goes out on presence \, so a never-present device is still recovered \, and u_present's give-up still reports it (item 235)., f 84;
#X obj 1300 1470 f;
#X obj 1460 1420 r \$0-seen-ever;
#X obj 1300 1530 select 0;
#X obj 1300 1590 symbol \$1;
#X obj 1300 1650 list prepend seen;
#X obj 1300 1710 list trim;
#X obj 1300 1770 s presence;
#X text 1300 2280 seen is published once \, on the first answer \, and the f is read before the flag is written. It lets g_oled's diag layer tell gone from never seen \, since lost goes out unarmed. The select's reject goes nowhere (C-8 \, ref/module/presence.md)., f 84;
